:: RobinTemple Corner
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "temple">><<temple_effects>><<effects>><<npc Robin>><<person1>>
<<language>>
  <<option 'EN'>>
    Robin has been given a narrow shelf and a place at the long table in the quarters. A schoolbook rests beside temple notes.
  <<option 'CN'>>
    罗宾在宿舍里分到一小格书架和长桌旁的座位。课本挨着神殿笔记。
<</language>>
<<if maplebirch.get('Robin') and $RobinExpansion?.shop>>
  <<language>>
    <<option 'EN'>>
      A page from the shop ledger marks Robin's place.
    <<option 'CN'>>
      店铺账本的一页夹在书里作书签。
  <</language>>
<<else>>
  <<language>>
    <<option 'EN'>>
      A stall receipt marks Robin's place.
    <<option 'CN'>>
      一张摊位收据夹在书页之间。
  <</language>>
<</if>>
<br><br>
<<if maplebirch.get('VP') and maplebirch.VP.realEstate.residenceOf('Robin')>>
  <<language>>
    <<option 'EN'>>
      Robin keeps a bunk for temple duties, but goes home to you when the work is done.
    <<option 'CN'>>
      罗宾在神殿留着床位，值班结束后会回到与你同住的家。
  <</language>>
  <br><br>
<</if>>
<<if $RobinTemple.vigil_result is 'passed'>>
  <<language>>
    <<option 'EN'>>
      Robin's new cloak hangs by the bunk. <<He>> still checks the work list with the older monks before taking a task, but no longer looks to Jordan for permission to enter the hall.
    <<option 'CN'>>
      罗宾的新斗篷挂在床铺旁。领工作时，<<he>>仍先请教年长的修士，却不再需要约旦准许才能走进大厅。
  <</language>>
  <br><br>
<</if>>
<<icon 'temple/RobinTemplebed.png'>><<lanLink '看看罗宾的床铺' 'RobinTemple Bunk'>><</lanLink>><br>
<<set _robinAtTemple to getRobinLocation() is 'temple' and !$robinmissing
  and $robin.timer.hurt is 0 and C.npc.Robin.trauma lt 80>>
<<if !_robinAtTemple>>
  <<language>>
    <<option 'EN'>>
      Robin is away. The work list and <<his>> schoolbook have been left on the table.
    <<option 'CN'>>
      罗宾现在不在。工作表和<<his>>的课本还放在桌上。
  <</language>>
<<elseif (Time.weekDay is 7 and Time.hour gte 21) or (Time.weekDay is 1 and Time.hour lt 7)>>
  <<language>>
    <<option 'EN'>>
      Robin has turned in for the night. <<His>> schoolbook lies closed beside the bunk.
    <<option 'CN'>>
      罗宾今晚睡在这里。<<His>>的课本合好，放在床铺旁。
  <</language>>
<<elseif Time.weekDay is 1 and Time.hour is 11>>
  <<language>>
    <<option 'EN'>>
      Robin is helping prepare the Sunday service. <<He>> will come back to the quarters when it ends.
    <<option 'CN'>>
      罗宾在帮忙准备星期日礼拜。结束后，<<he>>会回宿舍。
  <</language>>
  <<if $RobinTemple.work_day isnot Time.days
    and Time.minute lt 30>>
    <br><br>
    <<templeicon 'altar'>><<lanLink '去帮罗宾准备礼拜 (0:30)' 'RobinTemple Sunday Service'>><<pass 30>><</lanLink>><br>
  <</if>>
<<elseif Time.weekDay is 1 and Time.hour is 12>>
  <<language>>
    <<option 'EN'>>
      The Sunday service has begun. Robin is near the back of the hall, helping late arrivals find their seats.
    <<option 'CN'>>
      星期日礼拜已经开始。罗宾在大厅后方帮晚到的人找座位。
  <</language>>
<<elseif !Time.schoolDay and !Time.isWeekEnd() and Time.hour gte 9 and Time.hour lt 13>>
  <<if Time.hour lt 11>>
    <<language>>
      <<option 'EN'>>
        Robin is carrying tools between the temple garden and the quarters. <<He>> has left a note to say when <<he>> will return.
      <<option 'CN'>>
        罗宾正带着工具往返神殿花园和宿舍。<<He>>留下纸条，写了回来的时间。
    <</language>>
  <<else>>
    <<language>>
      <<option 'EN'>>
        Robin is helping in the hall. You hear <<his>> voice when the doors open.
      <<option 'CN'>>
        罗宾在大厅帮忙。门一开，你就听见了<<his>>的声音。
    <</language>>
  <</if>>
<<elseif !Time.schoolDay and !Time.isWeekEnd() and Time.hour gte 13 and Time.hour lt 16>>
  <<language>>
    <<option 'EN'>>
      Robin has the afternoon work list spread across the table. <<He>> moves a stack of clean linen so you can sit.
    <<option 'CN'>>
      罗宾把下午的工作表摊在桌上，挪开一叠干净布巾，让你坐下。
  <</language>>
  <br><br>
  <<if $RobinTemple.work_day isnot Time.days>>
    <<choreicon 'sweep'>><<lanLink '和罗宾一起打扫宿舍 (1:00)' 'RobinTemple Cleaning'>><<pass 60>><</lanLink>><br>
    <<templeicon 'garden'>><<lanLink '帮罗宾整理神殿物资 (1:00)' 'RobinTemple Supplies'>><<pass 60>><</lanLink>><br>
  <</if>>
<<elseif Time.hour lt 17 or Time.hour gte 20>>
  <<language>>
    <<option 'EN'>>
      Robin is elsewhere. The work list puts <<his>> next shift after school and work.
    <<option 'CN'>>
      罗宾现在不在这里。工作表上写着下一次值班，排在上学和生意之后。
  <</language>>
<<else>>
  <<language>>
    <<option 'EN'>>
      You find Robin reviewing the evening list. When <<he>> sees you, <<he>> turns the page so you can read it too.
    <<option 'CN'>>
      你找到罗宾时，<<he>>正在核对晚间工作表。看见你，<<he>>把纸转过来，让你也能看清。
  <</language>>
  <br><br>
  <<if $RobinTemple.work_day isnot Time.days>>
    <<choreicon "sweep">><<lanLink '和罗宾一起打扫宿舍 (1:00)' 'RobinTemple Cleaning'>><<pass 60>><</lanLink>><br>
    <<templeicon "garden">><<lanLink '帮罗宾整理神殿物资 (1:00)' 'RobinTemple Supplies'>><<pass 60>><</lanLink>><br>
  <</if>>
  <<if $robinromance is 1 and $RobinTemple.stage is 'member'
    and $RobinTemple.penance_day lt 0
    and ['monk', 'priest'].includes($temple_rank) and $RobinTemple.service gte 3
    and ($templePromised is '' or $templePromised is 'Sydney' and $sydneyromance is 1)>>
    <<loveicon "hug">><<lanLink '和罗宾谈谈承诺仪式' 'RobinTemple Promise Talk'>><</lanLink>><br>
  <</if>>
  <<if $robinromance is 1 and $RobinTemple.stage is 'member'
    and C.npc.Robin.dom gte 60 and $RobinTemple.service gte 2
    and !$RobinTemple.clasp_discussed>>
    <<socialiseicon 'ask'>><<lanLink '问罗宾贞操锁的事' 'RobinTemple Clasp'>><</lanLink>><br>
  <</if>>
  <<if $RobinTemple.stage is "approved">>
    <<templeicon "altar">><<lanLink '和罗宾去见约旦举行仪式' 'RobinTemple Promise Rite'>><</lanLink>><br>
  <</if>>
<</if>>
<<if _robinAtTemple and $RobinTemple.stage is 'promised'
  and Time.hour gte 11 and Time.hour lt 20
  and !(Time.weekDay is 1 and Time.hour lt 13)>>
  <br><br>
  <<language>>
    <<option 'EN'>>
      <span class='teal'>A thin silver ring catches the light when Robin reaches for your hand.</span>
    <<option 'CN'>>
      <span class='teal'>罗宾伸手牵你时，细银戒在光里一闪。</span>
  <</language>><br>
  <<if $RobinTemple.clasp_request isnot ''
    and Time.days gt $RobinTemple.clasp_request_day>>
    <<lockicon 'unlock'>><<lanLink '听罗宾与约旦商量的结果' 'RobinTemple Clasp Result'>><</lanLink>><br>
  <<else>>
    <<lockicon>><<lanLink '和罗宾谈谈贞操锁' 'RobinTemple Clasp'>><</lanLink>><br>
  <</if>>
<</if>>
<<if _robinAtTemple and $temple_rank is 'initiate'
  and ['member', 'approved', 'promised'].includes($RobinTemple.stage)
  and $RobinTemple.vigil_result isnot 'passed' and $RobinTemple.penance_day lt 0
  and $RobinTemple.service gte 3 and C.npc.Robin.revelationConviction gte 110>>
  <<if $RobinTemple.vigil_day lt Time.days
    and ($RobinTemple.vigil_attempt_day lt 0 or $RobinTemple.vigil_followup)>>
    <br><br>
    <<socialiseicon 'ask'>><<lanLink '问罗宾愿不愿意参加守夜' 'RobinTemple Vigil Before'>><</lanLink>><br>
  <<elseif $RobinTemple.vigil_prepared_day isnot Time.days
    and Time.days lte $RobinTemple.vigil_day>>
    <br><br>
    <<templeicon 'quarters'>><<lanLink '陪罗宾准备守夜 (0:30)' 'RobinTemple Vigil Prepare'>><<pass 30>><</lanLink>><br>
  <</if>>
<</if>>
<br>
<<getouticon>><<lanLink '返回神殿宿舍' 'Temple Quarters'>><</lanLink>><br>

:: RobinTemple Cleaning
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "temple">><<temple_effects>><<effects>><<npc Robin>><<person1>>
<<if $RobinTemple.work_day isnot Time.days>>
  <<set $RobinTemple.work_day to Time.days>><<set $RobinTemple.service += 1>>
  <<set C.npc.Robin.revelationConviction to Math.min(200, C.npc.Robin.revelationConviction + 3)>>
  <<language>>
    <<option 'EN'>>
      You clear the bunks while Robin sweeps between them. <<He>> pauses to help a younger initiate find a missing blanket, then comes back to finish the last row with you.
    <<option 'CN'>>
      你整理床铺，罗宾在床位之间扫地。<<He>>停下来帮一名年幼的见习者找回毯子，随后回来和你收拾完最后一排。
  <</language>>
  <br><br>
  <<language>>
    <<option 'EN'>>
      Jordan looks in before you leave. "Thank you, both of you."
    <<option 'CN'>>
      离开前约旦来巡视。“谢谢你们两个。”
  <</language>>
  <<grace 1>><<npcincr Robin love 1>><br><br><<ggrace>><<glove>>
<<else>>
  <<language>>
    <<option 'EN'>>
      The work is already done today.
    <<option 'CN'>>
      今天的工作已经做完了。
  <</language>>
<</if>>
<br><br>
<<icon 'temple/Robinquarters.png'>><<lanLink '回到罗宾的座位' 'RobinTemple Corner'>><</lanLink>><br>

:: RobinTemple Supplies
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "temple">><<temple_effects>><<effects>><<npc Robin>><<person1>>
<<if $RobinTemple.work_day isnot Time.days>>
  <<set $RobinTemple.work_day to Time.days>><<set $RobinTemple.service += 1>>
  <<set C.npc.Robin.revelationConviction to Math.min(200, C.npc.Robin.revelationConviction + 3)>>
  <<language>>
    <<option 'EN'>>
      A delivery has been left by the stairwell. Robin checks the list while you carry the lighter boxes inside. Some are meant for the kitchen; others hold clean sheets.
    <<option 'CN'>>
      楼梯旁堆着一批刚送到的物资。罗宾核对清单，你把较轻的箱子搬进屋里。一部分要送去厨房，其余装着干净床单。
  <</language>>
  <br><br>
  <<language>>
    <<option 'EN'>>
      Robin catches a mistaken count before it reaches the storeroom. <<He>> adds a note for the next shift, then hands you the pencil.
    <<option 'CN'>>
      罗宾发现有一项数量记错了。<<He>>给下一班留了张便条，随后把铅笔递给你。
  <</language>>
  <<grace 1>><<npcincr Robin dom 1>><br><br><<ggrace>><<gdom>>
<<else>>
  <<language>>
    <<option 'EN'>>
      The work is already done today.
    <<option 'CN'>>
      今天的工作已经做完了。
  <</language>>
<</if>>
<br><br>
<<icon 'temple/Robinquarters.png'>><<lanLink '回到罗宾的座位' 'RobinTemple Corner'>><</lanLink>><br>

:: RobinTemple Sunday Service
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to 'temple'>><<temple_effects>><<effects>><<npc Robin>><<person1>>
<<if Time.weekDay is 1 and Time.hour is 11
  and $RobinTemple.work_day isnot Time.days>>
  <<set $RobinTemple.work_day to Time.days>>
  <<set $RobinTemple.service += 1>>
  <<language>>
    <<option 'EN'>>
      The hall is filling. Robin lays out the prayer books while you help an older visitor find a seat. When the last row is ready, Robin checks the count with Jordan.
    <<option 'CN'>>
      大厅里渐渐坐满了人。罗宾摆好祈祷书，你扶一位年长的访客找到座位。最后一排准备妥当后，罗宾与约旦核对人数。
  <</language>>
  <br><br>
  <<if $RobinTemple.vigil_result is 'passed'>>
    <<if C.npc.Robin.dom gt 50>>
      <<language>>
        <<option 'EN'>>
          Jordan asks Robin to read a short passage aloud. <<He>> marks the line with a finger and speaks clearly enough for the back row to hear. Afterwards, <<he>> finds you by the remaining books. "How was that?"
        <<option 'CN'>>
          约旦请罗宾朗读一小段经文。<<He>>用手指沿着字行，读得后排也能听清。结束后，<<he>>在剩下的祈祷书旁找到你。“刚才读得怎么样？”
      <</language>>
    <<else>>
      <<language>>
        <<option 'EN'>>
          Jordan asks Robin to read a short passage aloud. <<He>> loses <<his>> place once and glances toward you. You find the line and point to it. Robin finishes the reading, then returns to the work list with you.
        <<option 'CN'>>
          约旦请罗宾朗读一小段经文。<<He>>一时找不到读到哪儿，朝你望来。你替<<him>>找到那一行，指给<<him>>看。罗宾读完，和你一起回到工作表前。
      <</language>>
    <</if>>
  <<else>>
    <<language>>
      <<option 'EN'>>
        "Working the counter taught me to count quickly," Robin says. <<He>> leaves the front row clear for those who arrived late.
      <<option 'CN'>>
        “做生意倒让我学会了算得快，”罗宾说。<<He>>把前排留给晚到的人。
    <</language>>
  <</if>>
  <<set C.npc.Robin.revelationConviction to Math.min(200, C.npc.Robin.revelationConviction + 3)>>
  <<grace 1>><<npcincr Robin love 1>><br><br><<ggrace>><<glove>>
<<else>>
  <<language>>
    <<option 'EN'>>
      The service has already begun, or today’s work is finished.
    <<option 'CN'>>
      礼拜已经开始，或是今天的工作已经做完了。
  <</language>>
<</if>>
<br><br>
<<icon 'temple/Robinquarters.png'>><<lanLink '回到罗宾的座位' 'RobinTemple Corner'>><</lanLink>><br>
